  "note": "Election of the Kilkeel Urban Council, poll due Wednesday 21 May 1952; nine nominations for the nine seats, no contest (Newry Reporter, 8 May 1952, p. 1). The nine are printed with further particulars (omitted here). Messrs. J. V. Sloan and J. A. Annett did not seek re-election; Henry Mackintosh and Henry Haugh are the new members. Returned unopposed."
